
## 1️⃣ Network & Compute (Foundation Layer)

Ye wo layer hai jiske bina kuch bhi nahi chalta:

### 🔹 Network

* VNet, Subnet
* NSG, ASG
* Application Gateway, Firewall
* Bastion, NAT Gateway
* ExpressRoute, Private Endpoint
* Load balancing, routing, security

👉 **Ye foundation hai**
AKS, VM, App Service, sab isi pe baithte hain.

### 🔹 Compute

* VM / VMSS
* Images, disks, snapshots
* Availability set / zones
* VM extensions (agents, scripts)

👉 **Yahan se actual servers bante hain**

💡 **Enterprise landing zone me**

> Network + Compute = 60–70% core design

---

## 2️⃣ Platform & App Layer (PaaS)

Ye list ka second bada hissa hai:

* App Service (Web Apps)
* Container Apps
* AKS / Arc Kubernetes
* Functions
* Logic Apps
* Service Fabric

👉 **Developers yahin kaam karte hain**
👉 Infra team sirf guardrails banati hai

---

## 3️⃣ Data & Storage Layer

* Storage Account
* Azure SQL / MySQL / PostgreSQL
* CosmosDB
* Redis / Redis Enterprise
* NetApp, Elastic SAN

👉 **Data is king 👑**
Isliye Azure ne iske liye alag universe bana rakha hai.

---

## 4️⃣ Security, Identity & Governance (MOST IMPORTANT)

Ye wo part hai jo **interview + real prod dono me killer hai** 🔥

* Key Vault
* Policy
* Defender / Security Center
* Sentinel
* Lighthouse
* Blueprints
* RBAC / Authorization

👉 **Yahin se enterprise maturity dikhai deti hai**

💡 Senior DevOps / Cloud Engineer ka focus yahin hota hai.

---

## 5️⃣ Monitoring, Ops & Day-2

* Log Analytics
* Application Insights
* Monitor
* Alerts
* Chaos Studio
* Load Test
* Maintenance

👉 Infra banana easy hai
👉 **Run + observe + fix** karna real skill hai

---

## 6️⃣ Integrations & SaaS Ecosystem

Azure ne third-party ko bhi Terraform me la diya:

* Datadog
* Dynatrace
* New Relic
* Palo Alto
* NGINX
* Elastic

👉 Real enterprises yahi use karte hain.

