## Tumhare liye BEST Strategy (DevOps POV) 🎯

Agar tum DevOps / Cloud engineer ho (jo tum ho 👇), to:

### 🔥 Phase-1 (Must Have – 80% job work)

* Network (VNet, Subnet, NSG, LB, Private Endpoint)
* Compute (VM, VMSS)
* AKS
* Storage
* Key Vault
* Monitor + Log Analytics
* IAM / RBAC

### 🔥 Phase-2 (Enterprise Level)

* Firewall + App Gateway
* Azure Policy
* Hub-Spoke architecture
* Private DNS
* CI/CD + Terraform modules

### ❌ Phase-3 (Optional / Niche)

* SAP, Oracle, Qumulo
* Video Indexer
* Orbital
* Industry-specific stuff

